	(text "Output voltage for pressure sensor : 0-5V\nLoad = 9.67k\nVoltage divider for ADC input :\n	5V * 191k/(100k+191k) = 3.282V\nFilter cutoff :\n	1/2piRC = 1/((100k+10k)//191k * 10n) = 228 Hz"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 36.576 80.518 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9e549fe9-b27f-42fc-8aa9-393666489938")
	)
	(text "Load cell Output R.O. : 2+/-10% mV/V => 2.2mV/V\nA 5V on a 11mV max  => 3.3V/11mV = 300 V/V\n\nSelon datasheet INA125: G = 4+60kOhms/Rg => Rg = 60k/(300-4) = 202.7\nRg = 200 Ohms"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.732 173.228 0)
		(effects
